message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "Sigelith Desktop"
abstract: >-
  Windows application for the Sigelith public timestamp log. It computes SHA-256
  fingerprints locally — files never leave the computer — timestamps them, keeps
  proofs and PDF certificates, verifies proofs offline against the published keys,
  and checks the log's checkpoints against third-party copies (GitHub, the Internet
  Archive, Zenodo). Formerly BeatStamp.
